miniz 3.1.2 (library version 11.3.2), unmodified single-file release from
https://github.com/richgel999/miniz/releases/tag/3.1.2 (miniz-3.1.2.zip,
SHA-256 f0446d863f9c19926ad9483c523fdc42e42b8d4a6a431d27e09d49c79a140d9a).
License: MIT, see LICENSE.

Used only by src/installer.c to read the Tyrian 2000 zip (inflate + stored).
Built with MINIZ_NO_STDIO, MINIZ_NO_TIME, MINIZ_NO_DEFLATE_APIS and
MINIZ_NO_ZLIB_COMPATIBLE_NAMES (see the Makefile and visualc/opentyrian.vcxproj),
so there is no compressor, no zip writer and no stdio in the build.
